{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_731cb57b48e6469aae6dd52a","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"8:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"5164\">\n    <frame id=\"8:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"8:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"8:5\" name=\"Foodieland — recipe and food blog website\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"8:6\" name=\"Design a recipe website: discover featured and popular recipes, open a recipe with its ingredients and directions, browse and read blog articles, and contact the team. Desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"8:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"249\">\n      <text id=\"8:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"8:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 5 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button and a default Text Field. Design all other states, the header, the footer, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the wordmark, the social logos, the photos, the category images, the decorations, the avatars and the icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"198\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"8:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"554\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1925\">\n      <text id=\"8:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"8:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"8:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1836\">\n        <frame id=\"8:14\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"756\">\n          <text id=\"8:15\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"82\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"8:16\" name=\"Goal: Find something to cook today.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"8:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"8:18\" name=\"• Categories: “Categories” · “View All Categories” · Breakfast · Vegan · Meat · Dessert · Lunch · Chocolate, each with its image (Category_Breakfast … Category_Chocolate) • Chef promo: “Everyone can be a chef in their own kitchen” · copy (see DATA) · “Learn More” · Photo_Chef · Decor_Tomato · Decor_Onion • Featured recipe: “Hot Recipes” (Icon_Hot_Recipes) · “Spicy delicious chicken wings” · copy (see DATA) · 30 Minutes (Icon_Timer) · Chicken (Icon_Fork_Knife) · Avatar_John_Smith · John Smith · 15 March 2022 · “View Recipes” (Icon_Play) · Photo_Hero_Chicken_Wings · round badge “Handpicked Recipes” • Footer: see DATA (Footer) • Header: Logo_Foodieland · navigation Home / Recipes / Blog / Contact / About us · current: Home · Logo_Facebook · Logo_Twitter · Logo_Instagram • Instagram: “Check out @foodieland on Instagram” · copy (see DATA) · 4 posts, each with Avatar_Foodieland · “Foodieland.” · “Tokyo, Japan” · more (Icon_More) · photo · photo counter 1/3 · like (Icon_Like) · comment (Icon_Comment) · share (Icon_Send) · save (Icon_Save) · “Liked by craig_love and 44,686 others” · caption · “September 19” (see DATA) · “Visit Our Instagram” (Logo_Instagram) • More recipes: “Try this delicious recipe to make your day” · copy (see DATA) · 8 recipe cards with photo, title, time (Icon_Timer), category (Icon_Fork_Knife) and favorite (Icon_Favorite) · favorited: as marked in DATA • Newsletter: “Deliciousness to your inbox” · copy (see DATA) · email field “Your email address...” · “Subscribe” · Decor_Subscribe_Vegetables · Decor_Subscribe_Leaf · Decor_Subscribe_Salad • Simple and tasty recipes: “Simple and tasty recipes” · copy (see DATA) · 8 recipe cards with photo, title, time (Icon_Timer), category (Icon_Fork_Knife) and favorite (Icon_Favorite) · favorited: as marked in DATA · promo card: “Don’t forget to eat healthy food” · “www.foodieland.com” · Photo_Ad_Salad\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"520\" />\n          <text id=\"8:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"646\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"8:20\" name=\"→ “Healthy Japanese Fried Rice with Asparagus” card → 02_Recipe → Blog (nav) → 03_Blog → Contact (nav) → 05_Contact\" x=\"24\" y=\"672\" width=\"596\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"8:21\" name=\"02_Recipe\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"716\">\n          <text id=\"8:22\" name=\"02_Recipe\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"93\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"8:23\" name=\"Goal: Follow the recipe for Healthy Japanese Fried Rice with Asparagus.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"8:24\" name=\"MUST INC