{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   This is an unattended Figma product design benchmark session. The user's request (in Chinese): 在 Figma 文件 https://www.figma.com/design/r7fV6QN1cRiibeoCL5REPT/ 中完成完整设计——先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01·Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。\n   \n   Explicit constraints from the system/benchmark instructions:\n   - Confirm the assigned account via whoami before writing: must be zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (CONFIRMED)\n   - Use ONLY this assigned file (fileKey r7fV6QN1cRiibeoCL5REPT); do not create different files or switch accounts/teams\n   - Preserve all reference pages (00/01/02/04) and their existing nodes — the workspace delivery location is 03 · Workspace page (9:2), which starts empty\n   - Build exactly 5 frames named exactly: 01_Home, 02_Recipe, 03_Blog, 04_Blog_Post, 05_Contact; wire them as a clickable prototype with specified links\n   - All \"Must include\" content must appear; copy/data must match \"Fixed data\" verbatim; frame names fixed\n   - Brand colors #000000 and #E7F9FD and Inter typeface are FIXED; every other color, type scale, spacing, radii, elevation, page grid is the designer's to define consistently\n   - Reuse given Button and Text Field; build all other components (header, footer, nav, business components, states) as reusable components\n   - Use wordmark, social logos, photos, category images, decorations, avatars, icons from 04 · Media\n   - Workflow: whoami → get_metadata → read-only use_figma inspection → use_figma builds → get_screenshot verification of ALL required screens (multiple fix-and-recheck rounds allowed)\n   - Prototype interactions required after screens exist\n   - FORMAT REQUIREMENT: Before every tool call include a visible decision summary prefixed exactly 'Reasoning summary:'; after each tool result do the same before the next call; final response starts 'Reasoning summary: ...' then 'Final answer:' with the assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and remaining limitations\n   - Plugin API constraints: MUST use `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)` to change pages; MUST NEVER use loadAllPagesAsync, setPluginData, createImageAsync; load fonts before editing text; Inter styles are \"Semi Bold\"/\"Extra Bold\" (with spaces)\n   - Resolve routine choices autonomously; report actual limitations if permissions/quota block progress; never claim completion for unfinished work\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via use_figma tool (JavaScript, 50k char limit per call): figma.getNodeByIdAsync, component.createInstance(), figma.combineAsVariants, figma.setCurrentPageAsync, node.reactions (prototype), page.flowStartingPoints\n   - Image fill reuse: read imageHash + scaleMode from media COMPONENT fills, apply as imagePaint to rects/ellipses; per-instance fills override on instance children allows different photos per card instance\n   - Text overrides on component instances via setRangeFills / setRangeFontName (for nav current-item state)\n   - Font loading: await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Inter', style:'Regular'|'Medium'|'Semi Bold'|'Bold'})\n   - Design system definition: colors, type scale, 8px spacing grid, radii, elevation, 1440px desktop grid with 64px margins (1312 content)\n   - Component variant sets for states: Recipe Card (Default/Favorited), Checkbox (Unchecked/Checked), Pagination Item (Default/Active), Input Field (Default/Focused)\n   - Prototype wiring: node.reactions = [{trigger:{type:'CLICK'}, action:{type:'NODE', destinationId, navigation:'NAVIGATE', transition:{type:'DISSOLVE', duration:0.3}}}] (with fallback if enum invalid); flow starting points per page\n   - Off-canvas component library area at x ≈ -2600..-400 on workspace page\n   - Icons have white background fills (need bg override to none when recoloring on dark surfaces)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Figma file r7fV6QN1cRiibeoCL5REPT pages: 0:1 (00 · Start Here 设计任务)， 1:2 (01 · Foundations 视觉规范)， 1:3 (02 · Components 组件库)， 1:4 (04 · Media 素材库)， 9:2 (03 · Workspace — EMPTY, target page)\n   \n   - **Brief structure (frame 8:2 on 0:1)**: Product = \"Foodieland — recipe and food blog website\". Goal: recipe website with featured/popular recipes, recipe detail, blog, contact. Desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode. Evaluation: checklist coverage, data accuracy, flow completeness, hierarchy, visual quality, component reuse, state design.\n   \n   - **Foundations (1:2)**: Fixed: brand primary #000000 (main ink/action), brand tint #E7F9FD (signature soft tint), Inter typeface. Canvas 1440 wide, light mode, frame heights free. Everything else (neutrals, text colors, backgrounds, favorite/like color, states, type scale, spacing, radii, elevation, grid) is designer-defined.\n   \n   - **Components (1:3)**: Given only Button (1:28: 160×60, fill #000000, white text \"Button\" 1:29) and Text Field (1:31: 420×89; children Label text 1:32 black, Input frame 1:33 420×60 white with Placeholder text #8c8c8c).\n   \n   - **Media component ID map (04 · Media, all are COMPONENT nodes)**:\n     - Logos: Logo_Foodieland 7:15 (282×48, IMAGE hash fa9f0311b756d33a88641e4f2e6668ed3340c891 FIT), Logo_Facebook 7:48 (10×20), Logo_Twitter 7:50 (22×18), Logo_Instagram 7:49 (22×22)\n     - Decor: Decor_Onion 7:12, Decor_Tomato 7:14, Decor_Subscribe_Leaf 7:61, Decor_Subscribe_Salad 7:13, Decor_Subscribe_Vegetables 7:62 (all 120×120 FIT)\n     - Featured/promo photos: Photo_Ad_Salad 7:17 (232×220), Photo_Chef 7:19 (330×220), Photo_Chef_Contact 7:21 (163×220), Photo_Hero_Chicken_Wings 7:2