measure — replaced by lw computation: I create all link texts first at x0, sum widths, then reposition. But ft.findOne inside loop: after creating 4 texts, findOne by name — names unique 'Lnk/Recipes' etc. OK.\n\nAlso careful: in tx() I append then set x/y — for texts appended to COMPONENT root: fine (not instance). Inside components all good. The only instance-child position sets must be avoided: btnLabel dance uses resize only. ico sets position BEFORE appendChild — for instance root, position applies to instance itself → allowed anywhere (top-level instance). ✓\n\nAlso in Newsletter decor/text order: decor first, then title/copy, then field/button.\n\nRewrite Call 1 fully, with btnLabel helper. Also double-check `hd.strokes` individual weights API: strokeTopWeight etc. exist on FrameNode (individual strokes). OK.\n\nFor the Recipe Card variant heart color: after combineAsVariants, cf is inside set; findOne on cf still works.\n\nLet me also add positions: hd(-3400,0), ft(-3400,240), nl(-3400,520), pc(-3400,840), cardSet(-3400,1160), ct(-2700,1160).\n\nReturn ids.","signature":"f80e776bbc8f4d22ad3fca38"}],"id":"078636d8-fa9e-45a2-bc7d-4efd6c128eb4","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ed01e25d-1512-4496-b486-8851c6325863","uuid":"209c5b15-01a7-44a9-9bf2-02409b852918","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:36:40.547Z","thinking_duration_ms":31699}
