{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Unattended Figma product design benchmark. User request (Chinese): 在 Figma 文件 https://www.figma.com/design/r7fV6QN1cRiibeoCL5REPT/ 中完成完整设计——先阅读「00·Start Here」设计任务，参考「01·Foundations」视觉规范，复用「02·Components」组件，使用「04·Media」素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。\n\n   Constraints (from benchmark instructions):\n   - Account confirmed via whoami: zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai. Use ONLY file r7fV6QN1cRiibeoCL5REPT; never switch accounts/teams/files\n   - Preserve all reference pages (00/01/02/04) and their nodes; deliver into 03 · Workspace page (9:2), which started empty\n   - Build exactly 5 frames named: 01_Home, 02_Recipe, 03_Blog, 04_Blog_Post, 05_Contact; wire as clickable prototype with specified links\n   - All \"Must include\" content; copy/data verbatim from Fixed data; frame names fixed\n   - Brand colors #000000 and #E7F9FD + Inter typeface FIXED; all other colors/type/spacing/radii/elevation/grid designer-defined (chosen: body #4B4B52, muted #86868F, line #E9E9EC, fav #E5484D; scale 52/28/32/20/18/16/15/14/13; radii 24-32 cards, 999 pills; shadows soft)\n   - Reuse given Button (1:28) and Text Field (1:31); build all other components reusable; use media from 04 · Media\n   - Workflow: use_figma builds → get_screenshot verify ALL 5 screens, fix-and-recheck rounds allowed; prototype interactions after screens exist\n   - FORMAT: Before every tool call, a visible decision summary prefixed exactly 'Reasoning summary:'; after each tool result the same; final response starts 'Reasoning summary: ...' then 'Final answer:' with file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID (9:2), screen IDs, prototype work, limitations\n   - Plugin API: MUST `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)`; NEVER loadAllPagesAsync/setPluginData/createImageAsync; load Inter fonts (styles 'Regular','Medium','Semi Bold','Bold' — with spaces) before text\n   - Resolve routine choices autonomously; report real limitations; never claim unfinished work\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via use_figma (50k char/call): figma.getNodeByIdAsync, component.createInstance(), figma.combineAsVariants, figma.setCurrentPageAsync, node.reactions, page.flowStartingPoints\n   - **Instance override rules (empirically tested)**: instance root x/y OK; instance child characters/resize/visible/fills/textAutoResize/textAlignHorizontal/setRange* OK; instance child x/y (relative-transform) FAIL; instance grandchild position FAIL; constraints set partially applies (horizontal:'CENTER' sticks before vertical throws — wrap try/catch); resize dance resize(w+1,h)→resize(w,h) triggers constraint reflow → perfect text centering (centerOffset:0)\n   - btnLabel() pattern: `t.constraints={horizontal:'CENTER',vertical:'CENTER'}` in try/catch, set characters, resize(w+1), resize(w)\n   - Auto-layout components (Ingredient Item, Direction Step, Meta Pill, Author Chip, Button Secondary) so text overrides auto-center without position overrides\n   - Image fill reuse: read imageHash from media component fills → {type:'IMAGE',imageHash,scaleMode:'FILL'|'FIT'}; per-instance Photo fills override\n   - Icon instances: set inst.fills=[] to remove white bg; recolor vector children via c.fills=[S(color)]\n   - Variant sets: Recipe Card (State=Default/Favorited), Checkbox, Ingredient Item, Meta Pill (Icon=timer/fork), Pagination Item (State=Default/Active)\n   - Nav current-state via per-instance text overrides (fontName sb, fills ink, textDecoration UNDERLINE)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Figma file r7fV6QN1cRiibeoCL5REPT: pages 0:1 (brief), 1:2 (foundations), 1:3 (given components), 1:4 (media), 9:2 (03 · Workspace — target, now contains component library)\n   \n   - **CREATED COMPONENTS on page 9:2 (off-canvas x≈-3400)**:\n     - Site Header 14:2 (1440×104: 'Logo' instance, 'Nav/Home','Nav/Recipes','Nav/Blog','Nav/Contact','Nav/About us' texts from x620 gap36, social icons fb/tw/ig right)\n     - Site Footer 14:17 (1440×208: 'Logo', 'Lnk/Recipes','Lnk/Blog','Lnk/Contact','Lnk/About us' right-aligned, 'Tagline', 'Divider', 'Copyright', socials)\n     - Newsletter Card 14:34 (1312×232 tint r28: decors veggies/leaf/salad, 'Title', 'Copy', 'Email Field' = given field instance at (382,107) label hidden + Input resized 372×60 + placeholder 'Your email address...', 'Subscribe Button' = given btn at (770,136))\n     - Promo Card 14:46 (1312×220 tint r28: 'Ad Photo' 240×220 at x1024, 'Title' \"Don't forget to eat healthy food\", 'Link' www.foodieland.com underlined)\n     - Recipe Card set 14:82 (300×356: 'Photo' 300×260 r24, 'FavBadge' 48 white circle w/ heart, 'Title' 18 sb, 'Meta' w/ 'Time' '30 Minutes', 'Div', 'Category'; Favorited variant heart = #E5484D)\n     - Category Tile 14:83 (197×196 white stroke line r24: 'Image' 120×120, 'Name')\n     - Instagram Post 15:26 (310×514: 'Photo' 310×310 r20, 'Avatar' 44, 'User' Foodieland., 'Location' Tokyo Japan, more/like/comm/send/save icons, 'Liked' text with bold range 9-19 'craig_love', 'Caption' w310, 'Date' September 19)\n     - Article Card 15:46 (632×420: 'Photo' 632×250 r24, 'Title' 20 sb, 'Excerpt' 15 w632, 'Avatar' 40, 'Name', 'Date' right-aligned)\n     - Mini Recipe Item 15:53 (390×96: 'Photo' 96 r16, 'Title' 16 sb w274, 'By' 'By Andreas Paula')\n     - Checkbox set 15:62 (22×22: State=Unchecked white+line stroke 1.5 / State=Checked ink + white Icon_Check 12)\n     - Ingredient Item set 15:72 (AL row gap14 center: 'Box' checkbox instance + 'Text' 15 w340)\n     - Direction Step 15:73 (VERTICAL AL 792 wide gap16: 'Row' [Checkbox, 'NumBg' 40×40 ink circle + 'Num' white 16 b, 'Step title' 20 sb], 'Step text' 15 w700 lh24)\n     - Meta Pill set 15:90 (AL pill tint r999 pad20 gap10: 'Icon' 20 + 'Value' 15 m; variants Icon=timer / Icon=fork)\n     - Author Chip 15:91 (AL gap14: 'Avatar' ellipse 48 (default image aJoh), 'Col' ['Name' John Smith 15 sb, 'Date' 15 March 2022 13 muted])\n     - Search Bar 15:96 (632×72 white r16 stroke: 'Placeholder', 'Search Button' given btn at (456,6))\n     - Pagination Item set 15:104 (48×48 r12: State=Default white stroke / State=Active ink; 'Num' 15 centered)\n     - Select 15:105 (608×64 white r16 stroke: 'Value' Advertising, chevron down at 560)\n     - Button Secondary 15:109 (AL 160×60 white stroke ink 1.5 r999, 'Label'); Button Secondary/Hover (tint bg) at (-3220,3480); Button Primary/Hover (#26262B) at (-3040,3480) — IDs not captured\n     - Text Field / Focused 15:115 (420×89: 'Label' 14 m, 'Input' white r16 ink stroke 2, 'Placeholder')\n     - Text Field / Area 15:119 (420×269: 'Label', 'Input' 420×240 r16 line stroke, 'Placeholder')\n   \n   - **Given component internals (tested)**: Button 1:28 = 160×60 black pill, text child 'Button' Inter Medium 16 white (54.5,20.5) 51×19; Text Field 1:31 = 420×89: Label TEXT (0,0) Inter Medium 14 'Label'; Input FRAME (0,29) 420×60 white r16 stroke #DBE2E5; Placeholder inside Input (25,21) Inter Regular 15\n   \n   - **Media CID dict (keys→IDs, used in builds)**:\n     ```js\n     const CID={logo:'7:15',fb:'7:48',tw:'7:50',ig:'7:49',adv:'7:17',chef:'7:19',chefC:'7:21',hero:'7:26',bbq:'7:16',cauli:'7:20',meat:'7:22',ramen:'7:63',pasta:'7:24',dump:'7:27',fruity:'7:25',rice:'7:31',salmon:'7:66',mayo:'7:32',onepot:'7:67',rainbow:'7:68',straw:'7:52',trop:'7:53',lettuce:'7:54',wagyu:'7:55',wagyuA:'7:56',ig1:'7:29',ig2:'7:64',ig3:'7:30',ig4:'7:65',blogChef:'7:18',step:'7:23',hiring:'7:28',plantain:'7:51',lasagna:'7:57',aAlb:'7:3',aCou:'7:59',aDia:'7:58',aFoo:'7:5',aJoh:'7:4',aLes:'7:2',aRob:'7:7',aWad:'7:6',cBreak:'7:8',cChoc:'7:10',cDess:'7:9',cLun:'7:11',cMeat:'7:69',cVeg:'7:60',hot:'7:70',onion:'7:12',leaf:'7:61',salad:'7:13',veggies:'7:62',tomato:'7:14',arrow:'7:35',check:'7:33',chevD:'7:34',chevR:'7:38',comm:'7:36',favI:'7:37',fork:'7:40',like:'7:39',more:'7:41',play:'7:42',print:'7:43',save:'7:44',send:'7:45',share:'7:46',timer:'7:47',btn:'1:28',field:'1:31'};\n     ```\n   \n   - **Working helper code (proven, reuse verbatim in every build call)**:\n     ```js\n     const page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('9:2');\n     await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\n     for (const s of ['Regular','Medium','Semi Bold','Bold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Inter',style:s});\n     const F={r:{family:'Inter',style:'Regular'},m:{family:'Inter',style:'Medium'},sb:{family:'Inter',style:'Semi Bold'},b:{family:'Inter',style:'Bold'}};\n     const C={ink:'000000',body:'4B4B52',muted:'86868F',line:'E9E9EC',tint:'E7F9FD',fav:'E5484D',white:'FFFFFF'};\n     const H=h=>({r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255});\n     const S=(h,o)=>({type:'SOLID',color:H(h),opacity:o===undefined?1:o});\n     const P=(k,sc)=>{const f=CM[k].fills.find(p=>p.type==='IMAGE');return{type:'IMAGE',imageHash:f.imageHash,scaleMode:sc||'FILL'};};\n     function fr(p,x,y,w,h,name,fill,rad){const f=figma.createFrame();f.x=x;f.y=y;if(w!==null)f.resize(w,h);f.name=name;f.fills=fill?[S(fill)]:[];if(rad!==undefined)f.cornerRadius=rad;p.appendChild(f);return f;}\n     function im(p,k,x,y,w,h,sc,rad,name){const r=figma.createRectangle();r.x=x;r.y=y;r.resize(w,h);r.fills=[P(k,sc)];if(rad!==undefined)r.cornerRadius=rad;r.name=name||('img:'+k);p.appendChild(r);return r;}\n     function tx(p,chars,size,st,col,x,y,o){o=o||{};const t=figma.createText();t.fontName=F[st];t.characters=chars;t.fontSize=size;t.fills=[S(col||C.ink)];if(o.ls!==undefined)t.letterSpacing={unit:'PERCENT',value:o.ls};if(o.lh)t.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:o.lh};if(o.w){t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';t.resize(o.w,t.height);}t.name=o.name||chars.slice(0,28);p.appendChild(t);t.x=x;t.y=y;if(o.al)t.textAlignHorizontal=o.al;return t;}\n     function ico(p,k,x,y,w,h,col){const n=I(k);if(w)n.resize(w,h||w);n.x=x;n.y=y;n.fills=[];if(col)for(const c of n.children){if('fills'in c&&Array.isArray(c.fills)&&c.fills.length&&c.fills[0].type==='SOLID')c.fills=[S(col)];}p.appendChild(n);return n;}\n     function findOne(n,name){if('children'in n){for(const c of n.children){if(c.name===name)return c;const r=findOne(c,name);if(r)return r;}}return null;}\n     function btnLabel(b,label){const t=b.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT');try{t.constraints={horizontal:'CENTER',vertical:'CENTER'};}catch(e){}t.characters=label;const w=b.width,hh=b.height;b.resize(w+1,hh);b.resize(w,hh);return b;}\n     // Component registry R/RC + helpers:\n     function cardInst(fav){return findOne(RC.cardSet,'State='+(fav?'Favorited':'Default')).createInstance();}\n     function pillInst(icon){return findOne(RC.pill,'Icon='+icon).createInstance();}\n     function setCard(inst,photoKey,title,cat){findOne(inst,'Photo').fills=[P(photoKey)];findOne(inst,'Title').characters=title;findOne(inst,'Category').characters=cat;return inst;}\n     function navCurrent(hi,name){const t=findOne(hi,'Nav/'+name);t.fontName=F.sb;t.fills=[S(C.ink)];t.textDecoration='UNDERLINE';}\n     ```\n     Component registry IDs: `{header:'14:2',footer:'14:17',news:'14:34',promo:'14:46',cardSet:'14:82',cat:'14:83',igPost:'15:26',article:'15:46',mini:'15:53',checkbox:'15:62',ing:'15:72',step:'15:73',pill:'15:90',chip:'15:91',search:'15:96',pag:'15:104',select:'15:105',btn2:'15:109',tfFocused:'15:115',tfArea:'15:119'}`\n   \n   - **FIXED DATA (verbatim, required)**:\n     - Home hero: 'Hot Recipes' · 'Spicy delicious chicken wings' · 'Crispy outside, juicy inside and coated in a sticky, spicy glaze — these wings are ready in 30 minutes and disappear even faster.' · 30 Minutes · Chicken · Avatar_John_Smith · John Smith · 15 March 2022 · 'View Recipes' (Icon_Play) · Photo_Hero_Chicken_Wings · badge 'Handpicked Recipes'\n     - Simple and tasty recipes copy: 'Quick, everyday dishes with ingredients you can find at any supermarket.' Grid (order, fav=♥): 1. Big and Juicy Wagyu Beef Cheeseburger/Western/♥/wagyu 2. Fresh Lime Roasted Salmon with Ginger Sauce/Fish/salmon 3. Strawberry Oatmeal Pancake with Honey Syrup/Breakfast/straw 4. Fresh and Healthy Mixed Mayonnaise Salad/Healthy/♥/mayo 5. Chicken Meatballs with Cream Cheese/Meat/meat 6. Fruity Pancake with Orange & Blueberry/Sweet/♥/fruity 7. The Best Easy One Pot Chicken and Rice/Snack/onepot 8. The Creamiest Creamy Chicken and Bacon Pasta/Noodles/pasta. All '30 Minutes'\n     - More recipes copy: 'Fresh ideas for breakfast, lunch and dinner — pick one and get cooking.' Heading: 'Try this delicious recipe to make your day'. Grid: 1. Mixed Tropical Fruit Salad with Superfood Boosts/Healthy/♥/trop 2. Big and Juicy Wagyu Beef Cheeseburger/Western/wagyuA 3. Healthy Japanese Fried Rice with Asparagus/Healthy/rice 4. Cauliflower Walnut Vegetarian Taco Meat/Eastern/cauli 5. Rainbow Chicken Salad with Almond Honey Mustard Dressing/Healthy/♥/rainbow 6. Barbeque Spicy Sandwiches with Chips/Snack/bbq 7. Firecracker Vegan Lettuce Wraps - Spicy!/Vegan/lettuce 8. Chicken Ramen Soup with Mushroom/Japanese/♥/ramen\n     - Chef promo: 'Everyone can be a chef in their own kitchen' · 'Step-by-step recipes, clear timings and tips from our cooks help you make restaurant-quality food at home.' · 'Learn More' · Photo_Chef · Decor_Tomato · Decor_Onion\n     - Categories: Breakfast/Vegan/Meat/Dessert/Lunch/Chocolate + 'View All Categories'\n     - Instagram: 'Check out @foodieland on Instagram' + 'Visit Our Instagram'; captions: 1 'The vegetable dishes need to have certain vitamins for those people' 2 'Sweet food can bring someone happiness, as long as they don't eat too much' 3 'What do you do before you start cooking? Prepare the tools or the ingredients?' 4 'Steak is never wrong; it's perfect if you want a romantic dinner'; all: Avatar_Foodieland · Foodieland.