lthy'))? My findOne matches exact name. Write inline finder.\n\nIf reactions on instance children fail: create transparent overlay frames in each frame at nav text position (absolute within frame): read text.absoluteBoundingBox vs frame.absoluteBoundingBox → overlay at delta, size of text, fills transparent, reaction on overlay.\n\nSet flowStartingPoints. Return which links succeeded.","signature":"470aaaae062c49cd9b72fcfb"}],"id":"1bf93e15-2f7b-4661-a5a4-43f7a9e4d2a1","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ed01e25d-1512-4496-b486-8851c6325863","uuid":"33fe2fc5-7be4-448c-b078-2e1fd18c2954","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:54:40.994Z","thinking_duration_ms":12304}
