ke the others (light). Possibly setProperties on nested instance failed silently? In addIng I used ingInst(checked) — the variant selector picks State=Checked variant for checked → creates instance of Checked variant directly. Row 1 checkbox: looking closely at scaled image, appears same as others. Let me zoom later. Actually ingInst(checked) → variant includes 'checked' → 'State=Checked' ✓. The checkbox in Checked variant is ink circle with white check — in the screenshot, first checkbox looks white/empty. Hmm, could be rendering scale. I'll zoom screenshot of that region to verify.\n- Directions: steps ✓ with numbered circles. Step checkbox circles at left of numbers (unchecked) — as designed.\n- Step photo, TIP box ✓. Video cover with play ✓.\n- Other Recipe 3 minis ✓. Recommendations 4 cards ✓. Newsletter, footer ✓.\n- PRINT/SHARE buttons ✓.\n\nRemaining screenshots: 03, 04, 05. Get them now.","signature":"32a33c818dd74ddaac6d0349"}],"id":"dee12845-68f0-4f6a-a71e-38f40f1af044","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ed01e25d-1512-4496-b486-8851c6325863","uuid":"22233804-2d35-49c2-8426-ea25604ada92","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:57:34.202Z","thinking_duration_ms":15858}
