{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Unattended Figma product design benchmark. Original user request (Chinese): 在 Figma 文件 https://www.figma.com/design/r7fV6QN1cRiibeoCL5REPT/ 中完成完整设计——先阅读「00·Start Here」设计任务，参考「01·Foundations」视觉规范，复用「02·Components」组件，使用「04·Media」素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。\n\n   Benchmark constraints (still in force):\n   - Account confirmed via whoami: zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai. Use ONLY file r7fV6QN1cRiibeoCL5REPT; never switch accounts/teams/files\n   - Preserve all reference pages (00/01/02/04) and their nodes; deliver into 03 · Workspace page (9:2)\n   - Build exactly 5 frames named: 01_Home, 02_Recipe, 03_Blog, 04_Blog_Post, 05_Contact; wire as clickable prototype\n   - All \"Must include\" content; copy/data verbatim from Fixed data; frame names fixed\n   - Brand colors #000000 + #E7F9FD, Inter typeface FIXED; other choices designer-defined (body #4B4B52, muted #86868F, line #E9E9EC, fav #E5484D)\n   - Reuse given Button (1:28) and Text Field (1:31); reuse 04 · Media assets\n   - Workflow: use_figma builds → get_screenshot verify ALL 5 screens, fix-and-recheck allowed; prototype interactions required\n   - FORMAT: Before every tool call, visible decision summary prefixed exactly 'Reasoning summary:'; after each tool result the same; final response starts 'Reasoning summary: ...' then 'Final answer:' with file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID (9:2), screen IDs, prototype work completed, limitations\n   - Plugin API rules: MUST `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)`; NEVER loadAllPagesAsync/setPluginData/createImageAsync; load Inter fonts ('Regular','Medium','Semi Bold','Bold') before text\n   - Resolve routine choices autonomously; report real limitations; never claim unfinished work\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via use_figma (50k char/call): figma.getNodeByIdAsync, component.createInstance(), figma.setCurrentPageAsync, node.reactions, page.flowStartingPoints, absoluteBoundingBox\n   - **VALIDATED reactions schema (this session's key discovery)**: `node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:'<id>',navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:{type:'DISSOLVE',duration:0.3,easing:{type:'EASE_IN_AND_OUT'}}}]}]` — trigger type is 'ON_CLICK' NOT 'CLICK'; use plural `actions` array NOT singular `action`; transition REQUIRES easing object. Verified stored format round-trips.\n   - **flowStartingPoints schema**: `page.flowStartingPoints=[{nodeId:'<id>',name:'<frameName>'}]` — NO pageId key, name REQUIRED.\n   - Instance override rules: instance root x/y/resize/fills/reactions OK; instance child characters/resize/visible/fills/strokes/textAutoResize OK; instance child x/y (relative-transform) FAIL; constraints partial-apply (horizontal sticks, vertical throws) → resize(w+1,h)→resize(w,h) dance re-centers text\n   - Nested variant sets: ing 15:72 and pag 15:104 and cardSet 14:82 and pill 15:90 are COMPONENT_SETs — must pick child variant via findOne on set children, cannot call createInstance on the set\n   - Component self-link rule: skip self-links (01 nav Home, 03 nav Blog, 05 nav Contact stay unlinked as current-state)\n   - createFrame() auto-appends to currentPage — guard `if(p)p.appendChild(f)` for optional reparenting\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Figma file r7fV6QN1cRiibeoCL5REPT: pages 0:1 (brief), 1:2 (foundations), 1:3 (components), 1:4 (media), 9:2 (03 · Workspace — target page)\n   \n   - **BUILT SCREEN FRAMES (all on page 9:2, x positions 0/1540/3080/4620/6160)**:\n     - **01_Home = 17:44** (1440×4718): header instance (navCurrent 'Home'), hero (hot icon 36, 'Hot Recipes' 17sb, title 52b lh62 w560, copy w520, chip John Smith/15 March 2022, pills 30 Minutes/Chicken, View Recipes btn 200×60 + white play icon, hero photo 640×560 r32, white badge circle 140 'Handpicked Recipes'), Categories (6 tiles), Simple and tasty recipes (8 cards 4-col x=64+col*337 rows+404, fav variants), Promo instance, Chef band (tint 1312×340 r32, Learn More btn2), Try this delicious recipe grid (8 cards), Instagram (4 igPost x=64+i*334), Newsletter, Footer. Cards named 'Card/'+title.slice(0,20)\n     - **02_Recipe = 19:435** (1440×3536): centered title 44b w1200, chip, pills row centered (PREP TIME/COOK TIME labels 13sb muted + timer pills 15 Minutes + fork pill Healthy), rice hero 1312×500 r32, IngredientsCard (tint w448 r24: 'Ingredients' 22b, 'For main dish', 5 ing instances w/ white fills r12 pad 14/12 text w320, first CHECKED via ingInst(true), 'For the sauce' + 3, Nutrition white card 400 r16 with 5 label/value rows + note), PRINT/SHARE manual pill buttons (170×60 stroke ink 1.5), Directions col x584 w792 (3 step instances, step photo 792×420, TIP tint box), Video cover (rice 792×420 + white play circle 80), Other Recipe (3 minis x=64+i*461), You may like (4 cards), Newsletter, Footer\n     - **03_Blog = 20:627** (1440×2428): 'Blog & Article' 52b, copy, Search bar instance x744 (placeholder 'Search article, news or recipe...', Search btn via btnLabel), 6 article cards 2-col x=64/744 rows+468 (photos ramen/trop/blogChef/lasagna/plantain/hiring; names Wade Warren/Robert Fox/Dianne Russell/Leslie Alexander/Courtney Henry/Albert Flores; avatars aWad/aRob/aDia/aLes/aCou/aAlb; all '12 November 2021'), Tasty Recipes (3 minis meat/pasta/dump), Pagination (Active 1, 2-5 default, '…' text, Next manual 48×48 w/ chevR, centered startX), Newsletter, Footer. Article named 'Article/Full Guide to Becoming a P' (slice(0,26))\n     - **04_Blog_Post = 21:693** (1440×3308): centered title 44b, chip Dianne Russell/12 November 2021, blogChef hero 1312×500 r32, intro 17r lh28 w800 x320, Q1-Q3 (20sb q + 15r lh25 a), step photo 1312×500, Q4, pull quote (tint “ mark 64b + quote 28b lh38), Q5, 'SHARE THIS ON:' + fb/tw/ig icons 24, 'Check out the delicious recipes' + 4 cards (trop fav/wagyuA/rice/cauli), Newsletter, Footer\n     - **05_Contact = 23:803** (1440×2088): 'Contact us' 52b, form x64 (NAME tfF focus ink stroke / EMAIL ADDRESS + SUBJECT tfF w/ Input strokes overridden to line 1px, each resized 632; Select instance resized 632×64 'Advertising'; MESSAGE tfA Input resized 632×240; Submit = given btn via btnLabel), chefC photo x744 632×~788 r32, 'Check out the delicious recipes' + 4 cards, Newsletter, Footer. formEnd=1092\n   \n   - **PROVEN HELPER PREAMBLE (paste verbatim into every use_figma build/edit call)**:\n     ```js\n     const page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('9:2');\n     await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\n     for (const s of ['Regular','Medium','Semi Bold','Bold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Inter',style:s});\n     const F={r:{family:'Inter',style:'Regular'},m:{family:'Inter',style:'Medium'},sb:{family:'Inter',style:'Semi Bold'},b:{family:'Inter',style:'Bold'}};\n     const C={ink:'000000',body:'4B4B52',muted:'86868F',line:'E9E9EC',tint:'E7F9FD',fav:'E5484D',white:'FFFFFF'};\n     const H=h=>({r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255});\n     const S=(h,o)=>({type:'SOLID',color:H(h),opacity:o===undefined?1:o});\n     // CID dict (see below); CM built via: const CM={};for(const k in CID)CM[k]=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(CID[k]);\n     const P=(k,sc)=>{const f=CM[k].fills.find(p=>p.type==='IMAGE');return{type:'IMAGE',imageHash:f.imageHash,scaleMode:sc||'FILL'};};\n     const I=k=>CM[k].createInstance();\n     function fr(p,x,y,w,h,name,fill,rad){const f=figma.createFrame();f.x=x;f.y=y;if(w!==null)f.resize(w,h);f.name=name;f.fills=fill?[S(fill)]:[];if(rad!==undefined)f.cornerRadius=rad;if(p)p.appendChild(f);return f;}\n     function im(p,k,x,y,w,h,sc,rad,name){const r=figma.createRectangle();r.x=x;r.y=y;r.resize(w,h);r.fills=[P(k,sc)];if(rad!==undefined)r.cornerRadius=rad;r.name=name||('img:'+k);p.appendChild(r);return r;}\n     function tx(p,chars,size,st,col,x,y,o){o=o||{};const t=figma.createText();t.fontName=F[st];t.characters=chars;t.fontSize=size;t.fills=[S(col||C.ink)];if(o.lh)t.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:o.lh};if(o.w){t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';t.resize(o.w,t.height);}t.name=o.name||chars.slice(0,28);p.appendChild(t);t.x=x;t.y=y;if(o.al)t.textAlignHorizontal=o.al;return t;}\n     function ico(p,k,x,y,w,h,col){const n=I(k);if(w)n.resize(w,h||w);n.x=x;n.y=y;n.fills=[];if(col)for(const c of n.children){if('fills'in c&&Array.isArray(c.fills)&&c.fills.length&&c.fills[0].type==='SOLID')c.fills=[S(col)];}p.appendChild(n);return n;}\n     function findOne(n,name){if('children'in n){for(const c of n.children){if(c.name===name)return c;const r=findOne(c,name);if(r)return r;}}return null;}\n     function btnLabel(b,label){const t=b.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT');try{t.constraints={horizontal:'CENTER',vertical:'CENTER'};}catch(e){}t.characters=label;const w=b.width,hh=b.height;b.resize(w+1,hh);b.resize(w,hh);return b;}\n     function navCurrent(hi,name){const t=findOne(hi,'Nav/'+name);t.fontName=F.sb;t.fills=[S(C.ink)];t.textDecoration='UNDERLINE';}\n     // cleanup pattern before rebuild: for(const ch of [...page.children]){if(ch.name==='XX_YYY')ch.remove();}\n     ```\n   \n   - **VERIFIED MEDIA CID dict (every ID confirmed via getNodeByIdAsync this session)**:\n     ```js\n     const CID={aLes:'7:2',aAlb:'7:3',aJoh:'7:4',aFoo:'7:5',aWad:'7:6',aRob:'7:7',aCou:'7:59',aDia:'7:58',cBreak:'7:8',cDess:'7:9',cChoc:'7:10',cLun:'7:11',onion:'7:12',salad:'7:13',tomato:'7:14',logo:'7:15',bbq:'7:16',adv:'7:17',blogChef:'7:18',chef:'7:19',cauli:'7:20',chefC:'7:21',meat:'7:22',step:'7:23',pasta:'7:24',fruity:'7:25',hero:'7:26',dump:'7:27',hiring:'7:28',ig1:'7:29',ig3:'7:30',check:'7:33',chevD:'7:34',arrow:'7:35',comm:'7:36',favI